WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.447
The cowboy leaned toward them.

2
00:00:10.448 --> 00:00:16.644
A little afraid, Vinnie and Mandy moved to the other side of the wagon.

3
00:00:16.645 --> 00:00:18.858
"Come on out of there,"

4
00:00:18.859 --> 00:00:22.585
he said in a firm but friendly voice.

5
00:00:22.586 --> 00:00:26.261
The children crawled forward and looked out.

6
00:00:26.262 --> 00:00:30.401
"Wow!" Vinnie said loudly.

7
00:00:30.402 --> 00:00:34.054
A large herd of cattle was nearby.

8
00:00:34.055 --> 00:00:38.556
Vinnie counted about ten cowboys riding horses.

9
00:00:38.557 --> 00:00:42.568
The children started to climb out of the wagon.

10
00:00:42.569 --> 00:00:45.089
"Where are we? Oops!"

11
00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:48.678
cried Mandy, almost falling off the wagon.

12
00:00:48.679 --> 00:00:53.066
"Careful now, little one," the cowboy laughed.

13
00:00:53.067 --> 00:00:55.701
"We left Texas quite a while ago.

14
00:00:55.702 --> 00:00:58.869
We're in Kansas, on the Chisholm Trail."

15
00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:01.995
"Kansas?" cried Vinnie.

16
00:01:01.996 --> 00:01:07.106
"How did you two get in my wagon?" asked the cowboy.

17
00:01:07.107 --> 00:01:11.738
"Actually, we . . . ," stuttered Vinnie.

18
00:01:11.739 --> 00:01:17.105
"We wanted to go on an adventure!" Mandy interrupted.

19
00:01:17.106 --> 00:01:21.644
The cowboy smiled and shook his head.

20
00:01:21.645 --> 00:01:24.187
"You'll get adventure, all right.

21
00:01:24.188 --> 00:01:26.878
But this trail can be dangerous."

22
00:01:26.879 --> 00:01:31.481
The children introduced themselves, and Mandy said,

23
00:01:31.482 --> 00:01:34.192
"We promise not to bother you.

24
00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:36.684
Can we stay?"

25
00:01:36.685 --> 00:01:42.881
"Hey, Cookie! When's supper?" a young cowboy called to the man.

26
00:01:42.882 --> 00:01:47.095
"Wait a minute, my friend," Cookie shouted back.

27
00:01:47.096 --> 00:01:49.676
Then he turned to the children.

28
00:01:49.677 --> 00:01:52.931
"I'll talk to the boss to see if you can stay.

29
00:01:52.932 --> 00:01:56.024
Meanwhile, you can help me cook."

30
00:01:56.025 --> 00:02:01.154
Cookie asked the children to unload a frying pan and a large pot.

31
00:02:01.155 --> 00:02:07.793
Then, as Cookie picked up a sack of beans, another cowboy walked over.

32
00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:12.127
"Who are these kids?" he said.

33
00:02:12.128 --> 00:02:18.545
"They're Vinnie and Mandy, and they're on a big adventure," chuckled Cookie.

34
00:02:18.546 --> 00:02:21.249
He winked at the other man.

35
00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:23.062
"This is Frank, children.

36
00:02:23.063 --> 00:02:25.800
He's the trail boss."

37
00:02:25.801 --> 00:02:29.417
"That's right," said Frank sternly.

38
00:02:29.418 --> 00:02:31.052
"Come with me, Vinnie.

39
00:02:31.053 --> 00:02:33.191
I can use your help."

40
00:02:33.192 --> 00:02:35.762
Vinnie followed Frank.

41
00:02:35.763 --> 00:02:38.968
Mandy stayed behind to help Cookie.

42
00:02:38.969 --> 00:02:42.750
"What are we going to do?" asked Vinnie.

43
00:02:42.751 --> 00:02:47.047
Frank untied two horses from a nearby bush.

44
00:02:47.048 --> 00:02:49.501
"We need to move the herd,"

45
00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:52.976
explained Frank, getting on one horse.

46
00:02:52.977 --> 00:02:55.027
"Just follow me."

47
00:02:55.028 --> 00:03:01.535
Frank made a clicking noise with his tongue and then rode off.

48
00:03:01.536 --> 00:03:05.977
Nervously, Vinnie climbed onto the other horse.

49
00:03:05.978 --> 00:03:10.047
"Good horse," he said softly.

50
00:03:10.048 --> 00:03:12.707
The horse didn't move.

51
00:03:12.708 --> 00:03:16.723
Vinnie tried making the clicking noise like Frank.

52
00:03:16.724 --> 00:03:22.621
But his horse just lowered its head and ate some grass.

53
00:03:22.622 --> 00:03:29.208
Vinnie watched Frank circle the cattle, going in and out of the herd.

54
00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:32.858
He shouted and snapped a whip in the air.

55
00:03:32.859 --> 00:03:37.530
"Please, do something," Vinnie said to his horse.

56
00:03:37.531 --> 00:03:42.375
"First time on a horse?" asked Frank, riding over.

57
00:03:42.376 --> 00:03:45.236
"Yes, sir," said Vinnie.

58
00:03:45.237 --> 00:03:49.348
"Our horses know their job," said Frank.

59
00:03:49.349 --> 00:03:52.777
"But you need to show them who's boss."

60
00:03:52.778 --> 00:03:59.320
Frank showed Vinnie how to hold the reins and lightly kick with his heels.

61
00:03:59.321 --> 00:04:02.942
"Now, give it a try," ordered Frank.

62
00:04:02.943 --> 00:04:07.922
"Come on, horse!" Vinnie shouted in a strong voice.

63
00:04:07.923 --> 00:04:11.482
The horse moved slowly forward.

64
00:04:11.483 --> 00:04:18.843
Vinnie held on as tight as he could.
